  "summary_en": "Workshop paper on synthesizing voices for conversational robots, covering difficulties of backchannel and prosody synthesis, a scenario classification for robot voice evaluation, and ethical issues such as language bias, cultural dependence and gender in robot voice and identity design. No governance instrument is proposed.",
